<Slide
  style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#F7F3EA',
    fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif",
    padding: '68px 84px 56px 84px',
    position: 'relative',
  }}
>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 42, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0E3B3A', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
    人点确认，才占号
  </Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 500, color: '#14110F', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>
    AI 只给建议。不可回滚的操作，必须由人拍板。
  </Text>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 38 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFCF5', padding: 6, border: '1px solid rgba(20,17,15,0.16)' }}>
        <Image src="assets/booking-flow.png" style={{ width: 494, height: 422 }} />
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459' }}>实拍：换院区 → 科室跟着变 → 日期条 → 时段，号源实时查后端。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 24, paddingTop: 6 }}>
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1 }}>二次确认</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F', marginTop: 8 }}>
          确认后会占用该号源
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>
          下单一律先出预览卡，人点了才写库。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 440, height: 1, background: 'rgba(20,17,15,0.10)' }} />
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1 }}>真数据</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F', marginTop: 8 }}>
          换院区，可约科室跟着换
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>
          号源来自院区适配器，同号重复下单直接 409。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 440, height: 1, background: 'rgba(20,17,15,0.10)' }} />
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1 }}>可替换</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F', marginTop: 8 }}>
          接真实医院只换一个实现
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>
          HospitalAdapter 已抽象；当前是演示适配器，页面上写明。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 84, right: 84, bottom: 28, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>智诊通</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', fontWeight: 600 }}>去之前</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>—</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>在院内</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>—</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>回家后</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459' }}>07</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
